---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service | GOWELLDE" description="Terms of use for the GOWELLDE Welding Technology website and general terms for wholesale inquiries and orders." path="/terms-of-service/">
  <section class="py-14 bg-brand-light">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-black text-brand-dark mb-8">Terms of Service</h1>
      <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none bg-white rounded-lg p-8 shadow-sm">
        <p><em>Last updated: October 2026</em></p>
        <h2>Website use</h2>
        <p>Content on this website — including product images, specifications and texts — is provided for information purposes. Product specifications may change without notice; always confirm critical parameters with our sales team before ordering.</p>
        <h2>Prices</h2>
        <p>Displayed prices are indicative wholesale ranges (FOB China). Final prices depend on model configuration, order volume, and shipping terms, and are confirmed in a written quotation.</p>
        <h2>Orders</h2>
        <p>Orders are governed by the proforma invoice and sales contract agreed with each customer, including payment terms, lead time, warranty and shipping terms (typically FOB Qingdao, Incoterms 2020).</p>
        <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>Texts, images and design of this website may not be reproduced without permission. GOWELLDE and the GOWELLDE logo are trademarks of GOWELLDE Welding Technology.</p>
        <h2>Liability</h2>
        <p>Welding involves inherent hazards. Always follow the safety instructions in the machine manual and applicable local regulations. We are not liable for misuse of the equipment.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
